# ⚠️ Without this, `COPY orchestrator ./orchestrator` copies the developer's
# local node_modules OVER the one `npm ci` just installed in the image —
# slow, and on an Apple-silicon laptop building for linux/amd64 it overwrites
# correct binaries with the wrong architecture's.
**/node_modules

# Run data is real companies' corpora and outreach. It is gitignored; keep it
# out of a pushed image too, which is a second way to publish it.
runs
!runs/__smoke__

**/.git
**/.wrangler
**/.env
**/*.log
.DS_Store
